WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
- Here on our show we
wanna turn the spotlight

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.070
on some women and young ladies,

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.050
who have paved their own way to success.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.600
They are fearless.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.966
They are resilient.

00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:13.700
They are wild flowers.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.590
And we are so happy to introduce you

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.750
to our very first of many
wild flowers to come,

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.690
skateboarding sensation, Sky Brown,

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.940
has set her goals high literally,

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.800
and is said to become one of
the world's youngest Olympians

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.027
at just 12 years old.

00:00:33.027 --> 00:00:37.110
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.330
A few months ago,

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.790
a devastating fall actually
almost ended that dream,

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:48.520
but Sky refused to slow down
and she got right back up.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.230
This video may be difficult
for some people to watch

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.850
because it shows Sky's actual accident.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.903
So, be prepared and then take a look.

00:00:59.256 --> 00:01:02.339
(skateboard rolling)

00:01:11.379 --> 00:01:14.379
(footsteps patting)

00:01:16.638 --> 00:01:19.734
(siren wailing)

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:22.129
(helicopter blade whirling)

00:01:22.129 --> 00:01:26.379
- I don't usually post my
falls or talk about them.

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.500
Because I want people to
see the fun in what I do.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.890
(vital signs machine beeping)

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:34.610
And I just want everyone
to know that, it's okay.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:36.850
Don't worry, I'm okay.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:38.553
It's okay to fall sometimes,

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.183
and I'm just gonna get back
up and push even harder.

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:47.723
(Audience clapping and cheering)

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:54.269
- Sky, you're so amazing.

00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:56.990
- Thank you so much.

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:58.940
- Oh my gosh, how are you feeling now?

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:01.290
Of course, I have to ask.

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:04.454
- I am feeling awesome, back on skateboard

00:02:04.454 --> 00:02:09.160
I'm surfing now too, which is
awesome 'cause I missed it.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:11.750
I had my cast on, I couldn't do anything.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.610
- I hold you in the highest regard

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.630
I really do. You're amazing.

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:18.463
- Thank you.

00:02:18.463 --> 00:02:21.370
I was watching some of
your movies this morning

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.993
and you're amazing.

00:02:22.993 --> 00:02:26.230
- Oh. Thank you Sky
and I've always thought

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:29.710
that girls should do what boys
do while getting to be girls

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.770
and you are the living example of that

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:35.960
and you have so much to teach young girls.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:38.830
Another life lesson that you teach people

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:41.700
through what you're doing
and how you're behaving

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:46.620
and surging forward is when
you fall, you get back up.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:51.150
- Yeah, on Instagram
everything looks perfect.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.220
no one shows them falling.

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:57.950
So I thought, you know,
we all fall sometimes.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:02:59.400
And I also wanted to show that

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.740
even when you fall, I'm
gonna push back harder.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.130
- Actually we have an incredible video.

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:07.180
Can we show that you have some footage

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.400
of you getting right back up and on it.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.035
I've got a visual for this.

00:03:11.035 --> 00:03:13.500
(upbeat rock music)

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.020
Oh my gosh.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:18.380
If that isn't the perfect visual metaphor

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.690
for how it's done Sky.

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:24.040
You just show such
strength and resilience.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:28.490
Now, you are supposed to have
been in the 2020 Olympics.

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:33.030
What is it like when you have
a goal line and it gets moved?

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:35.300
How are you handling that?

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.587
And what's your prep for
going into 2021 Olympics?

00:03:38.587 --> 00:03:41.070
- I was definitely bummed.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:44.260
I thought that my dreams were done.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.840
Like it was fading away

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.020
but it just gives me a longer journey

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:52.250
to get better and pushing even harder

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.180
and I'm excited to see
all the girls next year

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:56.693
and see what they got. It's gonna be cool.

00:03:56.693 --> 00:03:59.510
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.010
- Once again Sky, you have blown my mind.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:02.970
You're like, you know what?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.130
I just have now more
time to work on my craft

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:06.980
and get better.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.343
Who are you?

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.710
How do you know so much?

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:15.520
There are monks on
mountaintops that have worked

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.069
for years to get where you are.

00:04:18.069 --> 00:04:19.443
- Thank you.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:21.303
- Oh my God.

00:04:21.303 --> 00:04:24.430
And I just have to say that
you're just so beautiful

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.490
and so cute and pretty on the inside

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.950
and pretty on the outside

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.270
and smart in here and brave in here

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:34.720
and we just love you
here and you know what?

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.090
We have a little gift
for you if that's okay.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.610
Danielle, do you mind rolling her in?

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.323
Thank you so much.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.860
I wrote a book called Wildflower

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:49.860
and I too love watching
girls do what boys can do

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.670
but be girls while they're doing it

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:56.110
and supporting each other
and having each other's back.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:59.020
So we got you a wildflower helmet

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.745
and a wildflower skateboard,

00:05:00.745 --> 00:05:02.270
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:05.630
and I am sure that you
have very particular gear

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:06.590
that you need to do.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.560
So if anything, consider this wall art

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:14.560
and a reminder that we
truly celebrate your journey

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:19.130
because Sky, I am forever
changed having met you

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.130
and learned about your
ability to be this wise

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.410
and this strong at 12.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:25.710
- Yeah, that's what I want to do.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.950
My dream is to inspire girls

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:31.780
and you can tell them, you
can do whatever boys can do.

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:34.010
And we're actually coming out with a song

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:38.227
that explains that you can be
pretty, get your nails done,

00:05:38.227 --> 00:05:39.680
get your hair done.

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.030
You can do whatever you want

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.321
and still be tough and do sports.

00:05:43.321 --> 00:05:44.380
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:48.140
- Wow. Sky, keep writing music

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:49.810
your next song should be,

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.990
I am limitless. I can be everything.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.130
Thank you.

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.084
And we'll be checking in if that's okay.

00:05:57.084 --> 00:05:57.917
- Thank you so much.

00:05:57.917 --> 00:05:59.060
(woman clapping)

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:00.030
- We love you Sky.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:01.489
Thank you so much.

00:06:01.489 --> 00:06:04.489
(soft techno music)

